      "cooked": "<p>PW Fanatic, VG Idealist, and AH Stuntman take on Freight Train, BB, and Miss Info in the beautiful Dok’Thorath Capital!</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/e53ce708138b549551c8890de51aab094549f59f.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/e53ce708138b549551c8890de51aab094549f59f\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e53ce708138b549551c8890de51aab094549f59f_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"wHVP4aNXHGTzFgckCbmqEr1eVXN\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e53ce708138b549551c8890de51aab094549f59f_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e53ce708138b549551c8890de51aab094549f59f_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e53ce708138b549551c8890de51aab094549f59f_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e53ce708138b549551c8890de51aab094549f59f_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1170×2532 153 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>What’s really cool is this one-shot allows you to play the game as Christopher truly intended - with one play and no power each hero turn.</p>\n<p>My fourth attempt ended with a great Stuntman game, so shoutout to the Green Grosser for giving Stuntman not one, but two whole free powers after he’d been building up.</p>",
