      "created_at": "2022-08-02T15:38:39.441Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/1848ef55b6f88a18da7dc7cd897e694426efcb3a.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/1848ef55b6f88a18da7dc7cd897e694426efcb3a\" title=\"Screenshot_2022-08-02-11-26-38\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1848ef55b6f88a18da7dc7cd897e694426efcb3a_2_281x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_2022-08-02-11-26-38\" data-base62-sha1=\"3sPIJOKaLfJFUZKFJ3RP0xNCcEq\" width=\"281\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1848ef55b6f88a18da7dc7cd897e694426efcb3a_2_281x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1848ef55b6f88a18da7dc7cd897e694426efcb3a_2_421x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1848ef55b6f88a18da7dc7cd897e694426efcb3a_2_562x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1848ef55b6f88a18da7dc7cd897e694426efcb3a_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_2022-08-02-11-26-38</span><span class=\"informations\">1440×2560 214 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>That one was not easy, took me 4 tries and I still feel like I got lucky.<br>\nI dont have much good advise.  I think I only used fanatics power once before she died due to Miss Information.  I started with fanatic drawing and i went with big floaty head to get rid of the Barons healing early.  Once Blade loses his resistances fanatic dealt most of her damage with Divine Focus which I rarely use in normal games but is a good suicided card.</p>\n<p>Good luck to all you trying to beat this one.</p>",
