      "created_at": "2022-08-02T21:41:25.444Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b02a06a8104009b87385f27f8600f2a2d6bb9b45.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/b02a06a8104009b87385f27f8600f2a2d6bb9b45\" title=\"Screenshot_20220802-160902\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b02a06a8104009b87385f27f8600f2a2d6bb9b45_2_225x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20220802-160902\" data-base62-sha1=\"p8q4EEKveH9SFR1r8czLWNh7c5D\" width=\"225\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b02a06a8104009b87385f27f8600f2a2d6bb9b45_2_225x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b02a06a8104009b87385f27f8600f2a2d6bb9b45_2_337x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b02a06a8104009b87385f27f8600f2a2d6bb9b45_2_450x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b02a06a8104009b87385f27f8600f2a2d6bb9b45_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20220802-160902</span><span class=\"informations\">720×1600 92.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Well I wasted no time losing this one, though it didn’t help that I was distracted waiting for a bus (which I apparently also missed).  Paying a little more attention next time will probably help, especially since I know what’s coming.</p>\n<p>Edit: Yep.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a8096d1a6628ce559efa7aecaca1e59d11c71f20.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/a8096d1a6628ce559efa7aecaca1e59d11c71f20\" title=\"Screenshot_20220802-184854\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a8096d1a6628ce559efa7aecaca1e59d11c71f20_2_225x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20220802-184854\" data-base62-sha1=\"nYwps7zAqd9MVDgPLLXjb7iOOmk\" width=\"225\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a8096d1a6628ce559efa7aecaca1e59d11c71f20_2_225x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a8096d1a6628ce559efa7aecaca1e59d11c71f20_2_337x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a8096d1a6628ce559efa7aecaca1e59d11c71f20_2_450x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a8096d1a6628ce559efa7aecaca1e59d11c71f20_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20220802-184854</span><span class=\"informations\">720×1600 87.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Very, very close game.  Stylish Armor made all the difference, that and very carefully optimizing the interaction between Environment damage, Unshackled Destiny, and Blade’s Devices.  Heroes at 0, 1, and 2 HP… always a fun ending.</p>",
